  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HMA Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will reduce civilian harm from explosive ordnance in Hama and Homs through community liaison, contamination assessment, non-technical survey, clearance, and risk education. It will support safe return, access to farmland, homes, schools, water, and other basic services, while strengthening national mine action coordination and the capacity of a Syrian partner organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
